[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Through the Forest]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:10.02]How did Mrs. Sterling get her bag back? | 斯特林夫人是怎么拿回提包的？
[00:15.23]Mrs. Anne Sterling did not think of the risk | 安妮·斯特林夫人穿过森林追赶两个男人时，
[00:18.74]she was taking when she ran through a forest after two men. | 并没有想到自己所冒的风险。
[00:24.91]They had rushed up to her while she was having a picnic at the edge of a forest | 刚才，正当她和孩子们在森林边缘野餐时，
[00:30.39]with her children and tried to steal her handbag. | 这两个人冲到她跟前，企图抢走她的手提包。
[00:35.01]In the struggle, the strap broke and, | 在争抢中，手提包的带子断了，
[00:38.40]with the bag in their possession, | 包落入这两个人手里，
[00:41.12]both men started running through the trees. | 他们拔腿跑进了森林。
[00:45.45]Mrs. Sterling got so angry that she ran after them. | 斯特林夫人非常气愤，向着他们追了过去。
[00:51.07]She was soon out of breath, | 只追了一会儿便上气不接下气了，
[00:53.23]but she continued to run. | 但她还是继续追赶。
[00:56.22]When she caught up with them, | 当她赶上他们时，
[00:58.28]she saw that they had sat down and were going through the contents of the bag, | 发现他们已经坐了下来，正在翻包里的东西。
[01:04.50]so she ran straight at them. | 于是她直冲过去。
[01:07.81]The men got such a fright that they dropped the bag and ran away. | 这两个人吓了一跳，扔下提包逃跑了。
[01:14.75]'The strap needs mending,' said Mrs. Sterling later, 'but they did not steal anything.' | “这带子需要修理，”斯特林夫人事后说道，“不过他们什么也没偷走。”
